{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/066e9d2be8249d4386772b7c5acb7bbb.avif?t=1765234146\" width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summit Drive a game by Luke Kim</strong>\u00a0is a driving game where you play as an anthropomorphic bird who must make their way up to the mountain summit for a view like none other. It blends the mechanical absurdity of Enviro-bear 2000\u2019s controls with A Short Hike\u2019s cozy, quirky aesthetic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/1fcf2c8efdd97b0b0441a1a326406cf3.poster.avif?t=1765234146\" width=1600 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/1fcf2c8efdd97b0b0441a1a326406cf3.webm?t=1765234146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/1fcf2c8efdd97b0b0441a1a326406cf3.mp4?t=1765234146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a physics-based vehicle using only your mouse buttons for directional control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You must use your left mouse to interact, drive, and steer, while using your right mouse button to brake and change gears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/df9723dc57ecc067553c5864a84b0272.poster.avif?t=1765234146\" width=1600 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/df9723dc57ecc067553c5864a84b0272.webm?t=1765234146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/df9723dc57ecc067553c5864a84b0272.mp4?t=1765234146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path upwards is narrow, steep, bumpy, and filled with obstacles that appear before your eyes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game explores the fear of driving and falling, blending them into a metaphor for life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose all of your progress again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is great! You will love the music...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road is right ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to drive up?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871250?t=1765234146","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/4006ac0d886d5ccf84a71e65d99f30d898e28ab1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765234146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/acbb3820625aa2a6bae4a4d07695aa910f4581fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765234146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/acbb3820625aa2a6bae4a4d07695aa910f4581fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765234146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3887410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871250/extras/066e9d2be8249d4386772b7c5acb7bbb.avif?t=1765234146\" width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summit Drive a game by Luke Kim